          <Pad Id="LrjloAAoNxx8TtkLEj6rjA" Bounds="580,418,320,80" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Nearest Points gives one coordinate on each geometry: the two ends of the line you would draw. Point turns them into geometry again.">
